(5) Congregate with others to halt the flow of vehicular or pedestrian traffic or to otherwise gather in such a manner resulting in the halting of the flow of vehicular or pedestrian traffic.
(Code 1990, § 17-46; Ord. of 8-23-2011)

824:
The chief of police or city police officers under his direction shall:
(1) Attend all meetings of the city council and municipal court court sessions or any other meetings as directed by the city council;
(2) Execute all orders and directions of the city manager;
(3) Abate or remove any nuisance when so directed by the city manager upon order of the city council;
